Compiler                clang++
Assembly                %_FileName%%32
Type                    static_lib
SourceFiles             microsoft_craziness.cpp
Includes                ../../
CompilerFlags           -Os -Wno-writable-strings -nostdlib -nostdlib++
Defines                 RIFT_STATIC
BuildDirectory          ../Windows
IntermediateDirectory   ../../../Intermediate/microsoft_craziness
Assert.WorkingDirectory .

if 32 
{
    CompilerFlags -m32
    LinkerFlags   --target=i386-pc-windows-msvc 
}
